    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "In MultiEnding Heroes, you\u2019ll join The Priest and The Hero on a wild adventure, where your decisions shape the fate of our brave (and occasionally clueless) heroes. Will they rise to greatness or stumble into disaster? With over 50 unique endings to discover, it\u2019s up to you to guide them through every possible fate!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nKey features<br />\r\nUnlock All Endings: The ultimate goal is to experience more than 50 endings! Each choice branches the story in new directions. Some endings lead to triumph, while others may leave our heroes in hilariously unfortunate situations.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nProgress That Carries Over: Items and magics carry over to the next run, giving you more options in the future. The more you play, the more paths and endings you can uncover!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nChoices matter:<br />\r\nEvery action matters. Whether you\u2019re casting magic, using items in critical moments, or even chatting with enemies mid-battle, your decisions will shape the heroes\u2019 fate and the world around them.",
    "about_the_game": "In MultiEnding Heroes, you\u2019ll join The Priest and The Hero on a wild adventure, where your decisions shape the fate of our brave (and occasionally clueless) heroes. Will they rise to greatness or stumble into disaster? With over 50 unique endings to discover, it\u2019s up to you to guide them through every possible fate!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nKey features<br />\r\nUnlock All Endings: The ultimate goal is to experience more than 50 endings! Each choice branches the story in new directions. Some endings lead to triumph, while others may leave our heroes in hilariously unfortunate situations.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nProgress That Carries Over: Items and magics carry over to the next run, giving you more options in the future. The more you play, the more paths and endings you can uncover!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nChoices matter:<br />\r\nEvery action matters. Whether you\u2019re casting magic, using items in critical moments, or even chatting with enemies mid-battle, your decisions will shape the heroes\u2019 fate and the world around them.",
    "short_description": "Embark on a hilarious, choice-driven adventure in MultiEnding Heroes! Guide The Priest and The Hero through multiple universes, making decisions that lead to over 50 unique endings. Every choice matters, will you lead them to glory or disaster?",
